BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//NEMZ11//Williams Lean 80 Gym Plan//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Lean 80 Gym Plan
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Europe/Warsaw
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:workout-a-mon@nemz11
DTSTAMP:20261006T073000Z
SEQUENCE:2
SUMMARY:Lower Body A — Quads + Leg Size
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260914T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260914T194500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
DESCRIPTION:GOAL: Build leg size while cutting.\n\n1. Barbell Back Squat — 4 x 6–8 — rest 2–3 min\n2. Leg Press — 3 x 10–12 — rest 2 min\n3. Bulgarian Split Squat — 3 x 8–10 each leg — rest 90 sec\n4. Leg Extension — 3 x 12–15 — rest 60–90 sec\n5. Standing Calf Raise — 4 x 10–15 — rest 60 sec\n\nOptional: 10 min easy incline walk.\n\nPROGRESSION: Keep 1–2 reps in reserve on most sets. When you hit the top of the rep range with clean form\, increase the load slightly next time.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leg-growth-tue@nemz11
DTSTAMP:20261006T073000Z
SEQUENCE:2
SUMMARY:Upper Body A — Chest + Back + Arms
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260915T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260915T194500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
DESCRIPTION:GOAL: Build chest\, back and arms while supporting a lean athletic look.\n\n1. Incline Dumbbell Press — 4 x 8–10 — rest 2 min\n2. Chest-Supported Row — 4 x 8–12 — rest 2 min\n3. Lat Pulldown — 3 x 10–12 — rest 90 sec\n4. Cable Chest Fly — 2 x 12–15 — rest 60–90 sec\n5. Dumbbell or Cable Lateral Raise — 3 x 12–20 — rest 60 sec\n6. Rope Triceps Pushdown — 3 x 10–15 — rest 60 sec\n7. Dumbbell Biceps Curl — 3 x 10–12 — rest 60 sec\n\nOptional: 10–15 min easy/moderate incline walk if energy is good.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:recovery-wed@nemz11
DTSTAMP:20261006T073000Z
SEQUENCE:2
SUMMARY:Recovery — Walk + Mobility
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260916T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260916T191500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=WE
DESCRIPTION:Recovery day.\n\n30–45 min easy walk or normal daily movement.\n10–15 min hips\, ankles\, hamstrings and upper-back mobility.\nOptional core: Cable Crunch 3 x 12–15 + Plank 2 x 45–60 sec.\n\nKeep this easy. The goal is recovery\, not another hard workout.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:workout-b-thu@nemz11
DTSTAMP:20261006T073000Z
SEQUENCE:2
SUMMARY:Lower Body B — Glutes + Hamstrings
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260917T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260917T194500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TH
DESCRIPTION:GOAL: Build glutes and hamstrings while bringing lower-body size up.\n\n1. Romanian Deadlift — 4 x 6–10 — rest 2–3 min\n2. Hip Thrust — 4 x 8–12 — rest 2 min\n3. Walking Lunge — 3 x 10 each leg — rest 90 sec\n4. Seated or Lying Leg Curl — 3 x 10–15 — rest 90 sec\n5. Calf Raise — 4 x 12–20 — rest 60 sec\n6. Optional Hip Abduction — 2 x 15–20\n\nControl the lowering phase and prioritize full range of motion.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leg-shape-fri@nemz11
DTSTAMP:20261006T073000Z
SEQUENCE:2
SUMMARY:Upper Body B — Shoulders + Back + Chest
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260918T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260918T194500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=FR
DESCRIPTION:1. Flat Dumbbell or Machine Chest Press — 3 x 8–12 — rest 2 min\n2. One-Arm Cable or Machine Row — 3 x 8–12 each side — rest 90 sec\n3. Lat Pulldown or Assisted Pull-Up — 3 x 8–12 — rest 90 sec\n4. Seated Dumbbell Shoulder Press — 3 x 8–10 — rest 90 sec\n5. Lateral Raise — 4 x 12–20 — rest 60 sec\n6. Rear-Delt Fly or Face Pull — 3 x 12–20 — rest 60 sec\n7. Hammer Curl + Overhead Cable Triceps Extension — 2–3 x 10–15 each\n\nOptional: 10–15 min easy incline walk if recovered.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:optional-pump-sat@nemz11
DTSTAMP:20261006T073000Z
SEQUENCE:2
SUMMARY:Full Body + Legs — Light Pump
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260919T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Warsaw:20260919T193500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SA
DESCRIPTION:GOAL: Lighter hypertrophy/pump day — not a third heavy leg day.\n\n1. Hack Squat or Leg Press — 3 x 10–15 — rest 2 min\n2. Step-Up — 3 x 10 each leg — rest 90 sec\n3. Leg Curl — 3 x 12–15 — rest 60–90 sec\n4. Cable Row — 3 x 10–12 — rest 90 sec\n5. Push-Up or Machine Chest Press — 3 x 10–15 — rest 90 sec\n6. Cable Crunch — 3 x 12–15 — rest 60 sec\n7. Optional 15–20 min easy Zone 2 cardio.\n\nLeave 2–3 reps in reserve and finish feeling better than you started.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:full-rest-sun@nemz11
DTSTAMP:20261006T073000Z
SEQUENCE:2
SUMMARY:Full Rest — No Gym
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260920
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260921
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
DESCRIPTION:Full rest. Priorities: sleep\, protein\, hydration and easy walking if you feel like it. Do not try to make up missed calories or workouts. Start the next week fresh.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
